es will compete with yours.", "title": "Its partners sit on competing boards."}, "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "c83d4858-109f-5bb3-8123-cd3c603cef58", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "takeaway", "variant": null, "section": "overview", "sort_order": 4, "text": {"text": "No suit by a16z against a founder was found.", "title": "Close to clean with its own founders."}, "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "d2a33d8c-4661-557e-b2ed-72a55a4cd5bb", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "takeaway", "variant": null, "section": "overview", "sort_order": 5, "text": {"text": "Horowitz: \u201cwe're not founder-friendly.\u201d See Zenefits, 2016.", "title": "Expect the company to come before the founder."}, "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "b138490d-adf1-5d72-aa37-a2ca894a525e", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "takeaway", "variant": null, "section": "overview", "sort_order": 6, "text": {"text": "Token-buyer suits (Lido, Compound) argue VCs are partners of the DAOs they fund.", "title": "Crypto founders carry more of its legal risk."}, "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "44555fe1-b89e-5cd4-a5c5-1f9c1d3c9abd", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "takeaway", "variant": null, "section": "overview", "sort_order": 7, "text": {"text": "$15B+ raised in Jan 2026; $106.5B AUM across 119 funds.", "title": "Money isn't the constraint."}, "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "92b0e7d1-ccfb-5db3-a65d-762c49973f4d", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "takeaway", "variant": null, "section": "overview", "sort_order": 8, "text": {"text": "Three senior exits in 2025: Pande, Wennmachers, O'Farrell.", "title": "Confirm your partner's tenure."}, "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "ceae8181-5d4b-57bc-97d9-bbf4c6bfe46f", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "score_part_rule", "variant": null, "section": "score", "sort_order": 9, "text": "Bad events are measured as a share of the ~1,456 companies a16z has backed. Under 1% costs nothing. \u22123 per case the fund lost or where fraud was found.", "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "fd8c4360-876d-5097-987a-d2261d37dab8", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "score_part_rule", "variant": null, "section": "score", "sort_order": 10, "text": "Money 6 + media 6 (capped) + help after the check 5.5. Claims the fund makes about itself count at half until founders confirm them. Partner departures cost points.", "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "b2533331-66c6-5014-8a36-17b0271e29ed", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "score_part_rule", "variant": null, "section": "score", "sort_order": 11, "text": "Only first-hand accounts count. If negative accounts are under 1% of the portfolio, the fund gets its age default.", "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "f3e4800a-74a4-5844-aac3-b9fc2f5e378f", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "score_part_rule", "variant": null, "section": "score", "sort_order": 12, "text": "\u22121 per documented conflict, scaled by partner count. The section can't go below 0.", "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "71f0a40d-daf1-57eb-9ae1-6b00de365073", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "score_part_rule", "variant": null, "section": "score", "sort_order": 13, "text": "+1 for every 5 years of investing with no significant pattern of harm, up to +3.", "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "d610c3bb-a5f8-59d6-ace5-d3b7332b380b", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "score_part_rule", "variant": null, "section": "score", "sort_order": 14, "text": "Penalty only; a clean record earns 0. Open investigation \u22122. Shareholder suit against a partner as a public-company director \u22120.5 to \u22121.", "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "d64ac861-5869-51ce-85e9-3bff195a7bca", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "ask_question", "variant": null, "section": "ask", "sort_order": 15, "text": {"n": "01", "q": "In your last 3 down or flat rounds, did you lead, follow or walk?", "title": "Down rounds, bridges, pay-to-play"}, "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "5aba7cc3-1ea8-571a-a3f2-1885e14949f7", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "ask_question", "variant": null, "section": "ask", "sort_order": 16, "text": {"n": "02", "q": "What share of your seed/A companies did you reinvest in at the next round, including the strugglers?", "title": "Follow-on and pro rata"}, "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "b9872371-bdf2-58aa-8441-cb25f39989a9", "firm_id": "12876402-54cb-47e2-ad2a-d270d5c5bd79", "kind": "ask_question", "variant": null, "section": "ask", "sort_order": 17, "text": {"n": "03", "q": "When did you last back replacing a founder-CEO, and how did it happen?", "title": "Replacing founder-CEOs"}, "model": "(record at generation)", "prompt_version": "report-v2", "generated_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00+00:00", "review_status": "approved", "stale": false, "data_status": "real", "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:10:32.882947+00:00"}, {"id": "57c4a8be-ca56-5ddf-b941-7f0d4bcaa219", "firm_id": "